This repository is an integration/tutorial project. It includes source snapshots and
small binaries for the listed open-source projects. See each source directory for
the original license and upstream URL.

The repository does not redistribute NVIDIA DLSS model/runtime DLLs, ReShade runtime
binaries, OptiScaler binaries, or the RenoDX DLSS5 add-on. Obtain those components
from their respective authors or official distribution channels.

Upstream projects:
- https://github.com/NIGos/dlss5-dx11-bridge (MIT)
- https://github.com/AizawaHikaru233/genshin_fsr_brigde (GPL-3.0)
